  "published": "2026-10-14T20:30:53.267Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.14.2: fixed CS1737 in the generated code for a Utf8/WideChar string parameter after a parameter with a default value, the private platform imports have no default values (only the call methods), default values of numbers without a redundant cast. 1.14: diagnostics reported by an analyzer (live in the IDE, configurable in .editorconfig), ImportLibraryAttribute for the libraries of a class, NativeStringMarshalling (Utf8, WideChar) for string parameters, methods with errors no longer stop the whole class, ref readonly parameters, attribute types marked as embedded (no CS0436 through InternalsVisibleTo). New diagnostics PI1007-PI1017. Requires Roslyn 4.14 (VS 2022 17.14+, .NET SDK 9.0.300+).",
